                  (A (higham11_7_tridiagonalTwoByTwoSecondPivotIndex n)
                    (higham11_7_tridiagonalBranchLeadingIndex n
                      PivotSize.two)) ^ 2)) *
                infNorm A) ≤
        c_bound * u * infNorm A ∧
      gammaValid fp 3 ∧
      0 ≤ c_bound ∧ 0 ≤ c_rec ∧ 0 ≤ u

